dbr:Best_of_the_Best_3%3A_No_Turning_Back a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Best of the Best 3: No Turning Back"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Best of the Best 3: No Turning Back is a 1995 martial arts action film directed by the film's star Phillip Rhee. It is the second sequel in the Best of the Best film series. The film co-stars Christopher McDonald, Gina Gershon, Dee Wallace and an uncredited R. Lee Ermey and an uncredited Michele Bartlett. Rhee's Tommy Lee returns to his small hometown to find it under siege by a neo-Nazi gang whose leader is played by Mark Rolston."@en ;
