dbr:Blue_Juice a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Blue Juice"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Blue Juice is a 1995 British drama film directed by and starring Sean Pertwee, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Ewan McGregor, and Steven Mackintosh. It follows JC (Pertwee) as he attempts to reconcile his surfer lifestyle and loser friends with the pressure to grow up from his girlfriend (Jones). Blue Juice was set in Cornwall, and released in 1995 by FilmFour."@en ;
