dbr:Fierce_Creatures a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Fierce Creatures"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Fierce Creatures is a 1997 British-American farcical comedy film. While not literally a sequel, Fierce Creatures is a spiritual successor to the 1988 film A Fish Called Wanda. Both films star John Cleese, Jamie Lee Curtis, Kevin Kline and Michael Palin. Fierce Creatures was written by John Cleese and directed by Robert Young and Fred Schepisi. The film was dedicated to Gerald Durrell and Peter Cook. Some scenes were filmed at Jersey Zoo, a zoological park founded by Durrell."@en ;
    dbo:director "http://dbpedia.org/resource/Robert_Young_(director)" ;
