dbr:Jimmy_Hollywood a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Jimmy Hollywood"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Jimmy Hollywood is a 1994 American comedy film written and directed by Barry Levinson and starring Joe Pesci and Christian Slater. It was released on April 1, 1994, and was a box office bomb, grossing just $3 million against its $30 million budget. While initially unsuccessful at the box office, it has since gained a cult following."@en ;
