    rdfs:label "Mr. Wrong"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Mr. Wrong is a 1996 American romantic black comedy film starring Ellen DeGeneres and Bill Pullman. It was a critical failure and box office bomb. DeGeneres used to mention it occasionally in her talk show, The Ellen DeGeneres Show, poking fun at the disastrous reception of her major film debut. As of 2022, it remains her first and last film as lead actor in a live action film."@en ;
