dbr:Real_Genius a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Real Genius"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Real Genius is a 1985 American comic science fiction film directed by Martha Coolidge and written by Neal Israel, Pat Proft, and Peter Torokvei. Starring Val Kilmer and Gabriel Jarret, the film, set on the campus of Pacific Tech, a science and engineering university similar to Caltech, follows Chris Knight (Kilmer), a genius in his senior year, who is paired with a new student on campus, Mitch Taylor (Jarret), to work on a chemical laser. The film received positive reviews from critics, and it grossed $12 million at the North American box office."@en ;
    dbo:director "http://dbpedia.org/resource/Martha_Coolidge" ;
