dbr:Romy_and_Michele%27s_High_School_Reunion a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Romy and Michele's High School Reunion"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Romy and Michele's High School Reunion is a 1997 American comedy film directed by David Mirkin and starring Mira Sorvino, Lisa Kudrow, and Janeane Garofalo. The plot revolves around two 28-year-old girls who appear to have not achieved much success in life, and decide to invent fake careers to impress former classmates at their ten-year high school reunion. The characters are taken from the stage play Ladies Room, which also featured Kudrow. The film received positive reviews from critics and is considered a cult classic."@en ;
