dbr:To_Gillian_on_Her_37th_Birthday a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "To Gillian on Her 37th Birthday"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "To Gillian on Her 37th Birthday is a 1996 American romantic drama film directed by Michael Pressman and starring Peter Gallagher and Claire Danes as a father and daughter struggling to come to terms with the tragic death of wife and mother, Gillian (Michelle Pfeiffer). The original score was composed by James Horner. The screenplay was adapted by David E. Kelley from the play of the same name by ."@en ;
